# Model weights. docker-compose mounts ./checkpoint from the host, so after the first start that
# folder holds the weights (~280 MB): `COPY . .` must not copy them into the image, where the
# mount would hide them anyway. The image keeps its own verified copy in /app/checkpoint-seed.
checkpoint/*
!checkpoint/.gitignore
!checkpoint/README.md
checkpoint-seed/

# Debug files
debug_*.png
